ass 3, :fail 0, :error 0}\nok    dao.stream.datagram-test/attach-resolves-only-what-the-composition-kept {:pass 5, :fail 0, :error 0}\nNS dao.stream.datagram-test tests 14 assertions 127 pass 127 fail 0 error 0\nSUMMARY {:namespaces 3, :load-failures 0, :tests 37, :assertions 185, :pass 185, :fail 0, :error 0}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
